<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rāsĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>scraped</i>, <i>shaved</i>, <i>smoothed</i>, <i>polished</i>, <i>smooth</i>, = levigatus (mostly <b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torno rasile buxum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 449</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					61, 168</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fibula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 318</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 7, 658</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calathi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					9, 76</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argentum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>vessels without raised work</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 56, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hasta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					4, 176</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmes,</span>”
				<i>deprived of the bark</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 23, 35, § 206</span></i>
			: scopuli, <i>smooth</i>, i. e. <i>without herbage</i>, <i>bare</i>, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ.</span> 3, 69.</div>
